cheetah - Local Safetensors inference and gateway

Usage:
cheetah                                  Load the model in the current directory and chat
cheetah <model-path>                      Load a model directory or Safetensors file and chat
cheetah chat <model-path>                 Same as above
cheetah serve <name-or-path> [options]    Run an OpenAI-compatible API server
cheetah inspect <model-path> [options]    Inspect Safetensors weights
cheetah load <model-path> [options]       Compatibility alias for inspect
cheetah init <source-dir> <destination-dir>  Prepare aligned static model shards
cheetah prepare <source-dir> <destination-dir>  Alias for init
cheetah context list [--context-dir <path>]  List saved contexts
cheetah context delete <name> [--context-dir <path>]  Delete a context
cheetah formats                           List supported formats
cheetah version                           Show the version (--version / -V)
cheetah help                              Show this help

Chat options:
--threads N          Number of inference threads (default: physical core count)
--max-tokens N       Maximum tokens to generate per turn (default: 256)
--ctx-size N         Context window size in tokens (default: 8192)
--temperature F      Sampling temperature (default: 0, deterministic; around 0.8 for varied output)
--top-p F            Nucleus sampling threshold (default: 0.9; only used when temperature > 0)
--top-k N            Number of top-k sampling candidates (default: disabled)
--repeat-penalty F   Repetition penalty (default: 1, disabled)
--seed N             Random seed for reproducible generation
--system "..."       System prompt, included only in the first turn
--context <name>     Resume a saved chat context
--context-dir <path> Context archive directory (also used by /save)

Ant memory options (cheetah init <source-dir> <destination-dir> | cheetah chat <model-path> | cheetah serve <name-or-path>):
--setup [bool]        Interactive Ant preset wizard (bare flag or true/false; alias of --ant-setup);
after setup, init/chat/serve execute with the configured settings
--ant-setup [bool]    Same as --setup
--ant <bool>          Enable/disable Ant memory optimization (default: true; bare --ant enables the preset)
--ant-vram <bytes>    VRAM pool size override in bytes (default: 8GiB)
--ant-ram <bytes>     RAM budget override in bytes (default: 16GiB)
--ant-disk-dir <path> Disk residency directory override
--ant-resident <id>   Repeatable unit id to keep resident
--ant-eviction-policy <policy> Eviction policy override
--ant-prefetch-stages <n> Prefetch stages override
--ant-allow-vram-swap <bool> Allow VRAM swap override
User-managed defaults live in <model-dir>/cheetah_ant_settings.json.

Server options (cheetah serve):
--model <name>        Model name or Safetensors model path (legacy syntax)
--model-dir <dir>     Directory to search for models by name (default: .)
--host <address>      Address to listen on (default: 127.0.0.1)
--port <port>         Port to listen on (default: 8080; 0 assigns a free port)
--max-concurrent-generations <N> Maximum concurrent inference requests (default: 1)
--generate-key        Generate and print an API key
--api-key <KEY>       Set the API key
These options can be combined with chat options to set server defaults.

Inspection options (cheetah inspect):
--all                 Show all tensors (default: at most 20)
--json                Output JSON
-o, --output <file>   Save the report to a file (overwrites; no terminal output)

Server API endpoints:
POST /v1/chat/completions    Supports streaming (SSE)
POST /v1/completions         Non-streaming only; prompt is sent as one message
GET  /v1/models              List loaded models
GET  /v1/models/:id          Get a single model
GET  /health                 Health check (no authentication required)

Examples:
cd /home/user/models/qwen-0.5b && cheetah
cheetah /home/user/models/qwen-0.5b --threads 8 --max-tokens 128
cheetah /home/user/models/qwen-0.5b --temperature 0.7 --top-k 50 --seed 42
cheetah /home/user/models/qwen-0.5b --system "You are a concise assistant."
cheetah /home/user/models/qwen-0.5b --temperature 0
cheetah serve qwen-0.5b --model-dir ./models --port 8080 --generate-key
cheetah serve /home/user/models/qwen-0.5b --port 8080 --api-key secret
cheetah inspect /home/user/models/qwen-0.5b
cheetah inspect ./model.safetensors --json
cheetah init ./hf-model ./prepared-model
cargo build --release --features cuda
CHEETAH_DEVICE=cuda ./target/release/cheetah /home/user/models/qwen-0.5b
cargo build --release --features metal
CHEETAH_DEVICE=metal ./target/release/cheetah /home/user/models/qwen-0.5b

Set CHEETAH_DEVICE to cpu (default), cuda, or metal; GPU choices require building with the matching --features option.
Enter /exit to leave a chat. Press Ctrl-C to stop the server.
